{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_53_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_53","text":"楞伽阿跋多羅寶經校勘說明","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_53_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_53","text":"一.是書校歷二週.一譯校.二刻校。","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_53_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_53","text":"二.譯校凡用三本。(一)梵文本入楞伽經.校註略稱梵本。(二)元魏菩提流支譯入","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_53_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_53","text":"楞伽經.略稱魏本。(三)唐實叉難陀譯大乘入楞伽經.略稱唐本。以上三種並舉","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_53_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_53","text":"則稱三本。","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_53_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_53","text":"三.譯校凡有四例。（一）各本品目文句歧異者.擇要註出曰.某本雲雲。（二）各本文","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_53_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_53","text":"義較暢者.擇要註出曰.勘某本雲雲。（三）因對勘各本而見今譯晦澀〈文句倒綴省","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_53_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_53","text":"略轉聲等〉或訛略者.則並註按語曰.今文雲雲。(四)又今譯名語應行訂正者.亦爲","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_53_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_53","text":"註出曰.勘某本此語應譯雲雲。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_53_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_53","text":"四.刻校用南宋刻爲底本.對勘麗刻訂正文字.附註曰.原刻雲雲.依麗刻雲雲。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_53_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_53","text":"五.今刊頌文悉依梵本釐正.註出序數.分頌排列。其詳略互異處.亦附註備考。","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_53_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_53","text":"六.校勘資料出處如次。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_53_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_53","text":"（一）梵本入楞伽經.Lan%ka^vata^ra-su^tra.日人南條文雄校刊本.一九二三年.","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_53_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_53","text":"京都版。","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_53_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_53","text":"（二）魏本入楞伽經.金陵刻經處會譯本。","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_53_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_53","text":"（三）唐本大乘入楞伽經.同上.又單行本。","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_53_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_53","text":"（四）本書南宋刻麗刻.悉依日本弘教書院縮刷正藏本及大正大藏經本之","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_53_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_53","text":"校註。","sortOrder":19}],"overrides":{}}